{"asset_key":"ep8/gameplay_story_18611120","episode":"ep8","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"18611120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1861112001:0":{"text":"노바리스의 “가을의 수확”이 정식으로 막을 올렸다.","source_cn":"诺珐斯的秋夜狂欢正式拉开了序幕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80055F6402652CBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1861112002:1":{"text":"음산하고 어두웠던 거리는 수많은 호박등으로 환하게 밝혀졌고, 주황빛 온기가 은하수처럼 길게 퍼져 나갔다. 부두와 시장은 물론이고, 높이 솟은 오션 오페라 극장의 외벽까지 형형색색의 축제 장식으로 가득했다.","source_cn":"原本阴冷幽暗的街道，此刻被成百上千盏南瓜灯点亮，橘色的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D798518A0C39A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1861112003:1":{"text":"사람들로 북적이는 거리에서 기상천외한 복장을 한 그레이브본들이 웃으며 사탕을 주고받고 있었고, 모두가 기대에 부푼 채 곧 오션 오페라 극장에서 시작될 특별 공연을 기다리고 있었다.","source_cn":"人群熙熙攘攘，穿着奇装异服的亡灵们在街头欢笑着交换糖果...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x660FC92F30521E2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1861112004:0":{"text":"와! 앞집 호박등이 켜졌어! 얼른 가서 문 두드리자!","source_cn":"哇！前面那户人家的南瓜灯亮了！快去敲门！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC86457F825059322","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1861112005:0":{"text":"하하, 서두르지 마. 오늘은 가을의 수확이잖니. 모두에게 줄 사탕은 충분하단다.","source_cn":"哈哈，别急别急，今天可是秋夜节，每个人都有！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB90DFB5EE2AF9359","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1861112006:0":{"text":"오늘 밤에 세니아가 무슨 공연을 할까?","source_cn":"你猜猜塞涅晚上会表演什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2247A71C8636D7C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1861112007:0":{"text":"「장미의 목소리」였으면 좋겠다...","source_cn":"希望会是《玫瑰之声》……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07D23D5CA56C8EB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1861112008:0":{"text":"언니, 이 사탕에 책 냄새가 담겨 있어...","source_cn":"姐姐，这颗糖里面封存了书卷的香气……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x093CDED0CC03B363","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1861112009:0":{"text":"마음에 들면 앞에 있는 노점에서 몇 개 더 사자.","source_cn":"喜欢的话，我们再去前面的摊位买几颗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFADE935729B423F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1861112009":{"text":"마음에 들면 앞에 있는 노점에서 몇 개 더 사자.","source_cn":"喜欢的话，我们再去前面的摊位买几颗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFADE935729B423F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1861112010:0":{"text":"바든 오빠, 세인! 여기 좀 봐!","source_cn":"巴登，瑟恩，看我这边！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BF67C88EBA3E6F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1861112011:0":{"text":"에리스?! 왜 그래!","source_cn":"爱丝？！你怎么了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A0EEE729E000C91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1861112012:0":{"text":"붉은 촛불꽃? 갑자기 왜 감염이...","source_cn":"赤烛蕊？！怎么会突然感染——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x788B2B4CAC007BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1861112013:0":{"text":"하하하! 속았지! 이건 그냥 급하게 만든 변장 소품이야!","source_cn":"哈哈哈！骗你们的！这只是我临时做的变装道具而已！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FE4E6D2000BA5B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1861112014:0":{"text":"어때? 진짜 같지? 다 놀랐지!","source_cn":"怎么样？是不是很逼真？把你们都吓到了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x904AC74824B8FA6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1861112015:0":{"text":"...장난치는 솜씨가 일취월장이네.","source_cn":"……这孩子的恶作剧也是越来越熟练了。","status