name></style>, 뭘 한 거지? 왜 시야가 이렇게...","variant_male_record_index":"251531","variant_female_record_index":"251532","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1861112023:0":{"text":"푸핫, 하하하하! 세인, 머리가 커다란 호박으로 변했어!","source_cn":"噗——哈哈哈！瑟恩，你的头变成了一个巨大的南瓜头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF452634AFECC4806","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1861112024:0":{"text":"뭐라고요?!","source_cn":"什么？！<key:dialog18>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE323532621A020AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1861112025:0":{"text":"세인, 정말 잘 어울려. 그런데... 왜 내 몸은 이렇게 딱딱해진 것 같지? 제대로 걷기도 힘든데?","source_cn":"相信我，瑟恩，这确实挺适合你的。不过……为什么我感觉我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BA32EDCA2237D7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1861112026:0":{"text":"하하하하! 오빠는 걸어 다니는 묘비가 됐으니까! 위에 이끼까지 자랐어!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！因为巴登你变成了一块会走路的墓碑啊！上面还长...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4393BFBD046EC42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1861112027:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 이 모습은 너무 이상하군. 어서 마법을 풀어라.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDC3F97922524D37